"P1707934735" "You either need to complete the missions your Patron has for you, or do previous work for me before I can put you on this task.<br><br>If you have not completed your Patron path, go and speak with them in Grandville. There you will find Ghost Widow, Captain Mako, Black Scorpion or Scirocco.<br><br>If you have no idea what I'm talking about, speak with Arbiter Rein in the Spider City neighborhood of Grandville."

